# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** CPU time is the post-processing time. The three mirror circuits were submitted together in one run, so the recorded QPU and CPU times are for all three circuits together. Each Clifford circuit run contained nine PUBs with different circuit depths, so the recorded times are for all nine PUBs together. Each Ising circuit run contained 10 PUBs with different numbers of Trotter steps, so the recorded times are for all 10 PUBs together.\n"
msgstr "**Nota:** Masa CPU ialah masa pasca-pemprosesan. Ketiga-tiga litar cermin diserahkan bersama dalam satu larian, jadi masa QPU dan CPU yang direkodkan adalah untuk ketiga-tiga litar bersama. Setiap larian litar Clifford mengandungi sembilan PUB dengan kedalaman litar yang berbeza, jadi masa yang direkodkan adalah untuk kesemua sembilan PUB bersama. Setiap larian litar Ising mengandungi 10 PUB dengan bilangan langkah Trotter yang berbeza, jadi masa yang direkodkan adalah untuk kesemua 10 PUB bersama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the mirror circuits, the benchmarks use the RealAmplitudes, TwoLocal, and EfficientSU2 ansätze with 30, 35, and 40 qubits, respectively. The observables consist of a single Pauli-$Z$ operator on a randomly selected qubit, with an ideal expectation value of 1.\n"
msgstr "Untuk litar cermin, penanda aras menggunakan ansatz RealAmplitudes, TwoLocal, dan EfficientSU2 dengan masing-masing 30, 35, dan 40 qubit. Observabel terdiri daripada satu operator Pauli-$Z$ pada qubit yang dipilih secara rawak, dengan nilai jangkaan unggul 1.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the Clifford circuits, the benchmarks use 50- and 100-qubit circuits with observables initialized as one or more randomly positioned Pauli-$Z$ operators. Operator evolution increases the Pauli weight of these observables, which provides more complex observables for benchmarking. The observables are constructed to have an ideal expectation value of 1, which is independently verified with stabilizer simulation.\n"
msgstr "Untuk litar Clifford, penanda aras menggunakan litar 50 dan 100 qubit dengan observabel yang dimulakan sebagai satu atau lebih operator Pauli-$Z$ yang diletakkan secara rawak. Evolusi operator meningkatkan pemberat Pauli observabel ini, yang menyediakan observabel yang lebih kompleks untuk penanda arasan. Observabel dibina supaya mempunyai nilai jangkaan unggul 1, yang disahkan secara bebas dengan simulasi penstabil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the Trotterized 2D tilted-field Ising (TFI) Hamiltonian simulations, the benchmarks use three parameter regimes: small angle $(\\theta_X,\\theta_Z,\\theta_{ZZ})=(0.1,0.1,0.1)$, near-Clifford $(0.1,0.05,1.5708)$, and chaotic $(0.53,0.1,1.0)$. The observable is the average magnetization,\n"
msgstr "Untuk simulasi Hamiltonian Ising medan condong 2D (TFI) yang ditrotterkan, penanda aras menggunakan tiga rejim parameter: sudut kecil $(\\theta_X,\\theta_Z,\\theta_{ZZ})=(0.1,0.1,0.1)$, hampir-Clifford $(0.1,0.05,1.5708)$, dan kacau $(0.53,0.1,1.0)$. Observabel ialah purata kemagnetan,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"O_M = \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_i Z_i,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"O_M = \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_i Z_i,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $M$ is the number of qubits in the simulation. Ideal expectation values are computed with sparse Pauli dynamics (SPD), a Pauli propagation method, and are validated against Qiskit statevector simulations for circuits with fewer than 29 qubits.\n"
msgstr "di mana $M$ ialah bilangan qubit dalam simulasi. Nilai jangkaan unggul dikira dengan dinamik Pauli jarang (SPD), kaedah perambatan Pauli, dan disahkan terhadap simulasi vektor keadaan Qiskit untuk litar dengan kurang daripada 29 qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For all benchmarks, mitigation accuracy is calculated as\n"
msgstr "Untuk semua penanda aras, ketepatan pengurangan ralat dikira sebagai\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Accuracy}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Accuracy}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\left(\n"
"1-\n"
"\\frac{\n"
"\\left|\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}-\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}\\right|\n"
"}{\n"
"\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}\n"
"}\n"
"\\right)\\times100\\%,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\left(\n"
"1-\n"
"\\frac{\n"
"\\left|\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}-\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}\\right|\n"
"}{\n"
"\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}\n"
"}\n"
"\\right)\\times100\\%,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}$ and $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}$ are the ideal and mitigated expectation values, respectively.\n"
msgstr "di mana $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}$ dan $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}$ masing-masing ialah nilai jangkaan unggul dan nilai jangkaan terkurang ralat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get support {#get-support}"
msgstr "Dapatkan sokongan {#get-support}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team is here to help. If you encounter any issues, have questions about using the AI-QEM Function, or need help troubleshooting a job, contact the support team.\n"
msgstr "Pasukan sokongan AI-QEM sedia membantu. Jika anda menghadapi sebarang masalah, mempunyai soalan tentang penggunaan Fungsi AI-QEM, atau memerlukan bantuan menyelesaikan masalah sesuatu kerja, hubungi pasukan sokongan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support: quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"
msgstr "Sokongan: quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To help the support team investigate and resolve your issue as quickly as possible, include the following information in your support request:\n"
msgstr "Untuk membantu pasukan sokongan menyiasat dan menyelesaikan masalah anda secepat mungkin, sertakan maklumat berikut dalam permintaan sokongan anda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function job ID (for example, `job.job_id`)\n"
msgstr "ID kerja Fungsi (contohnya, `job.job_id`)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A detailed description of the issue\n"
msgstr "Huraian terperinci tentang masalah tersebut\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Any relevant error messages, stack traces, or error codes\n"
msgstr "Sebarang mesej ralat, jejak tindanan, atau kod ralat yang berkaitan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expected behavior and actual behavior (if applicable)\n"
msgstr "Tingkah laku yang dijangkakan dan tingkah laku sebenar (jika berkenaan)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete information helps the support team diagnose issues more efficiently and resolve them faster.\n"
msgstr "Maklumat yang lengkap membantu pasukan sokongan mendiagnosis masalah dengan lebih cekap dan menyelesaikannya dengan lebih pantas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team also welcomes feedback and feature requests. If you have suggestions for improvements or capabilities that you want to see in future releases, send them to quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"
msgstr "Pasukan sokongan AI-QEM juga mengalu-alukan maklum balas dan permintaan ciri. Jika anda mempunyai cadangan penambahbaikan atau keupayaan yang ingin anda lihat dalam keluaran akan datang, hantarkannya ke quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"

